<p style="font-family:'DM Serif Display',serif;font-size:23px;line-height:1.45;margin:0;">Written notes of thanks from clients this year. The words that came up again and again: kindness, genuine care, and being treated with <span style="color:#f5b829;font-style:italic;">"respect and dignity."</span></p>
<p style="font-size:13.5px;color:#c9d2ea;margin:12px 0 0;line-height:1.6;">Every note of appreciation is shared with the staff member it names and added to their file.</p>
