<blockquote style="border-left:3px solid #f5b829;padding-left:20px;margin:0;"><p style="font-family:'DM Serif Display',serif;font-style:italic;font-size:18px;line-height:1.55;color:#1e3278;margin:0;">"They provide a chance to change the things in your life like trauma, abuse and life experiences in a positive way… I really appreciate this program because it made me change my life for the better and made me feel like my life matters."</p><cite style="display:block;font-style:normal;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:0.06em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#5b647a;margin-top:12px;">A survivor in our aftercare program</cite></blockquote>
<blockquote style="border-left:3px solid #f5b829;padding-left:20px;margin:0;"><p style="font-family:'DM Serif Display',serif;font-style:italic;font-size:18px;line-height:1.55;color:#1e3278;margin:0;">"I would just like to thank The Life Link program. You all have helped me so much. I could not be clean today without [staff]."</p><cite style="display:block;font-style:normal;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:0.06em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#5b647a;margin-top:12px;">A survivor in our aftercare program</cite></blockquote>
<div style="border-left:3px solid #2ab5a0;padding-left:20px;"><p style="font-size:15px;line-height:1.6;color:#3a4256;margin:0;">Survivor trauma scores tell the same story. The group's average PTSD score (PCL-5) fell to <b>31.33 — below the clinical cutoff of 33</b> for severe PTSD. Survivors who stayed engaged longest saw the greatest relief.</p></div>
</div>
