<p style="font-size:17px;line-height:1.75;color:#c9d2ea;max-width:480px;margin:0 0 32px;">Every figure on this page is a person someone refused to give up on. Your gift keeps that chain unbroken — a same-day assessment for someone in crisis, a key to a first apartment, a safe place for a survivor to begin again.</p>
